{% comment %}
  Why: Provides a unified, high-converting, beautifully styled Policy Hub
  for Scrunch & Create covering Terms & Conditions, Refund & Returns, Shipping,
  Privacy, and Contact information with instant URL hash and slug switching.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="sc-policy-section page-width" id="sc-policy-hub">
  <!-- Policy Header -->
  <div class="sc-policy-header">
    <span class="sc-policy-badge">Customer Trust &amp; Legal</span>
    <h1 class="sc-policy-title">Store Policies &amp; Help</h1>
    <p class="sc-policy-subtitle">
      Everything you need to know about shopping, shipping, refunds, and privacy at Scrunch &amp; Create.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="sc-policy-layout">
    <!-- Policy Navigation Sidebar / Top Tabs -->
    <nav class="sc-policy-nav" aria-label="Policy tabs">
      <button type="button" class="sc-policy-tab is-active" data-target="terms" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="policy-panel-terms">
        <span class="sc-tab-icon">📜</span>
        <span class="sc-tab-text">Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="sc-policy-tab" data-target="refund" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="policy-panel-refund">
        <span class="sc-tab-icon">🔄</span>
        <span class="sc-tab-text">Refund &amp; Returns</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="sc-policy-tab" data-target="shipping" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="policy-panel-shipping">
        <span class="sc-tab-icon">🚚</span>
        <span class="sc-tab-text">Shipping &amp; Delivery</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="sc-policy-tab" data-target="privacy" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="policy-panel-privacy">
        <span class="sc-tab-icon">🔒</span>
        <span class="sc-tab-text">Privacy Policy</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="sc-policy-tab" data-target="contact" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="policy-panel-contact">
        <span class="sc-tab-icon">💬</span>
        <span class="sc-tab-text">Support &amp; Contact</span>
      </button>
    </nav>

    <!-- Policy Content Panels -->
    <div class="sc-policy-content-wrap">
      
      <!-- 1. Terms & Conditions Panel -->
      <article class="sc-policy-panel is-active" id="policy-panel-terms" role="tabpanel" aria-label="Terms and Conditions">
        <div class="sc-panel-header">
          <div class="sc-panel-icon-wrap">📜</div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="sc-panel-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>
            <span class="sc-panel-updated">Last Updated: August 2026</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sc-panel-body">
          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>1. Introduction &amp; Overview</h3>
            <p>
              Welcome to <strong>Scrunch &amp; Create</strong> (https://scrunchcreate.myshopify.com). By visiting our website, purchasing our products, or interacting with our brand, you engage in our "Service" and agree to be bound by the following Terms and Conditions. Please review them carefully before placing an order.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>2. Handcrafted Products &amp; Uniqueness</h3>
            <p>
              All our hair accessories (Scrunchies, Hair Bows, Hairclips, Flower Jewellery, and Curated Gift Hampers) are proudly handcrafted with premium fabrics and artisanal care. Due to the handmade nature of our creations:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Minor variations in fabric pattern placement, stitching, or dimensions are natural characteristics of artisanal production.</li>
              <li>We make every effort to display accurate colors on our website; however, slight variations may occur across different screen displays and lighting conditions.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>3. Pricing &amp; Payments</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>All product prices are quoted in <strong>Indian Rupees (INR ₹)</strong> and are inclusive of applicable taxes.</li>
              <li>Prices and availability are subject to change without prior notice. We reserve the right to modify or discontinue any product at any time.</li>
              <li>Payments can be made securely via UPI, Credit/Debit Cards, Net Banking, and select wallets through verified payment gateways.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>4. Order Acceptance &amp; Modification</h3>
            <p>
              Once your order is successfully placed, you will receive an automated confirmation via WhatsApp, SMS, or Email. We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order in the event of stock unavailability, pricing errors, or suspected fraudulent activity.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>5. Intellectual Property</h3>
            <p>
              All content on this website—including product designs, images, logos, graphics, text, and design elements—is the exclusive intellectual property of <strong>Scrunch &amp; Create</strong>. Unauthorized reproduction, resale, or distribution is strictly prohibited.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>6. Governing Law</h3>
            <p>
              These Terms and Conditions and any separate agreements whereby we provide you Services shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 2. Refund & Cancellation Panel -->
      <article class="sc-policy-panel" id="policy-panel-refund" role="tabpanel" aria-label="Refund and Return Policy" hidden>
        <div class="sc-panel-header">
          <div class="sc-panel-icon-wrap">🔄</div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="sc-panel-title">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h2>
            <span class="sc-panel-updated">Last Updated: August 2026</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sc-panel-body">
          <div class="sc-highlight-box sc-highlight-box--pink">
            <strong>🎀 Hygiene &amp; Safety Notice:</strong> Due to the personal nature of hair accessories, opened or used items cannot be returned or exchanged. Returns and replacements are accepted exclusively for damaged, defective, or incorrect items.
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>1. Return &amp; Replacement Eligibility (5-Day Window)</h3>
            <p>We take immense pride in crafting each item with stringent quality checks. However, if you receive a damaged or incorrect product, you are eligible for an immediate free replacement or refund under the following conditions:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>The issue must be reported within <strong>5 days</strong> of delivery.</li>
              <li>The item must be unused, unwashed, and in its original packaging with tags intact.</li>
              <li><strong>Mandatory Requirement:</strong> An unboxing video recorded from the moment the sealed courier package is opened is required to substantiate damage, defect, or missing item claims.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>2. How to Request a Return or Replacement</h3>
            <p>Initiating a claim is quick and hassle-free:</p>
            <ol>
              <li>Send your Order Number, unboxing video, and clear photos of the issue to our WhatsApp Support: <strong>+91 7300969491</strong> or email <strong>scrunchandcreate@gmail.com</strong>.</li>
              <li>Our customer support team will inspect the details and respond within <strong>24 business hours</strong>.</li>
              <li>Upon verification, we will arrange a reverse pickup or ship a replacement order immediately at zero extra cost to you.</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>3. Refund Processing &amp; Timelines</h3>
            <p>
              Once your return is inspected and approved:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Refunds will be processed back to your <strong>original payment method</strong> (UPI / Bank Account / Card) or issued as store credit based on your preference.</li>
              <li>Please allow <strong>5 to 7 business days</strong> for the refunded amount to reflect in your bank account or card statement.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>4. Order Cancellation Policy</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Orders can be cancelled before dispatch (usually within <strong>12 hours</strong> of placing your order).</li>
              <li>Once dispatched from our studio with a tracking ID assigned, an order cannot be cancelled in transit.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 3. Shipping & Delivery Panel -->
      <article class="sc-policy-panel" id="policy-panel-shipping" role="tabpanel" aria-label="Shipping and Delivery Policy" hidden>
        <div class="sc-panel-header">
          <div class="sc-panel-icon-wrap">🚚</div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="sc-panel-title">Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</h2>
            <span class="sc-panel-updated">Last Updated: August 2026</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sc-panel-body">
          <div class="sc-highlight-box sc-highlight-box--green">
            <strong>🎉 Free Shipping Offer:</strong> Enjoy <strong>100% FREE Standard Shipping</strong> on all domestic orders of <strong>₹499 and above</strong> across India!
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-grid">
            <div class="sc-policy-stat-card">
              <span class="sc-stat-num">1-2 Days</span>
              <span class="sc-stat-label">Studio Processing Time</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-policy-stat-card">
              <span class="sc-stat-num">2-4 Days</span>
              <span class="sc-stat-label">Metro City Delivery</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-policy-stat-card">
              <span class="sc-stat-num">4-7 Days</span>
              <span class="sc-stat-label">Rest of India Delivery</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-policy-stat-card">
              <span class="sc-stat-num">₹49</span>
              <span class="sc-stat-label">Flat Shipping Under ₹499</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>1. Order Processing Time</h3>
            <p>
              Each Scrunch &amp; Create accessory is handcrafted, quality-inspected, and packaged in protective aesthetic boxing. Orders are typically processed and handed over to our courier partners within <strong>1 to 2 business days</strong> (excluding Sundays and national holidays).
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>2. Shipping Rates &amp; Delivery Estimates</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Orders ₹499 &amp; Above:</strong> FREE Standard Shipping.</li>
              <li><strong>Orders Below ₹499:</strong> Flat ₹49 standard shipping charge nationwide.</li>
              <li><strong>Metro Cities:</strong> Estimated delivery in 2 to 4 business days.</li>
              <li><strong>Tier 2 &amp; Tier 3 Cities / Non-Metro:</strong> Estimated delivery in 4 to 7 business days.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>3. Real-Time Order Tracking</h3>
            <p>
              As soon as your package is dispatched, you will receive an automated tracking link via <strong>WhatsApp and SMS</strong> with your courier tracking number (e.g. Delhivery, Bluedart, Xpressbees, India Post). You can track your parcel in real-time until it safely arrives at your doorstep.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>4. Delivery Address &amp; Contact Details</h3>
            <p>
              Please ensure your delivery address, landmark, PIN code, and mobile phone number are accurate during checkout. Our courier partners attempt delivery up to 3 times before returning the parcel to our origin studio.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 4. Privacy Policy Panel -->
      <article class="sc-policy-panel" id="policy-panel-privacy" role="tabpanel" aria-label="Privacy Policy" hidden>
        <div class="sc-panel-header">
          <div class="sc-panel-icon-wrap">🔒</div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="sc-panel-title">Privacy Policy</h2>
            <span class="sc-panel-updated">Last Updated: August 2026</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sc-panel-body">
          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
            <p>When you visit our store or complete a purchase, we collect the necessary personal details to fulfill your order safely:</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Name, phone number, email address.</li>
              <li><strong>Shipping Details:</strong> Delivery address, landmark, state, and postal code.</li>
              <li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Processed through PCI-DSS compliant payment gateways. We never view or store sensitive credit card numbers or banking passwords.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>2. How We Use Your Data</h3>
            <p>Your privacy is paramount to us. We strictly use your personal data for:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Processing, fulfilling, and dispatching your orders.</li>
              <li>Sending live shipping notifications and delivery updates via SMS and WhatsApp.</li>
              <li>Customer service communication and addressing support inquiries.</li>
              <li>Improving store experience and preventing fraudulent transactions.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>3. Data Protection &amp; Third-Party Sharing</h3>
            <p>
              <strong>We do NOT sell, rent, or trade your personal information</strong> with third-party advertisers. We only share essential delivery information with verified logistics partners (courier companies) solely for order delivery.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card">
            <h3>4. Cookies &amp; Tracking</h3>
            <p>
              We use essential cookies to power store functionality (like remembering items in your cart) and analyze general website performance. You can choose to disable cookies through your browser settings at any time.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 5. Support & Contact Panel -->
      <article class="sc-policy-panel" id="policy-panel-contact" role="tabpanel" aria-label="Contact and Support Information" hidden>
        <div class="sc-panel-header">
          <div class="sc-panel-icon-wrap">💬</div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="sc-panel-title">Support &amp; Contact Information</h2>
            <span class="sc-panel-updated">We're Here to Help</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sc-panel-body">
          <div class="sc-contact-grid">
            <a href="https://wa.me/917300969491?text=Hi%20Scrunch%20%26%20Create,%20I%20have%20a%20question%20about%20my%20order" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sc-contact-card sc-contact-card--whatsapp">
              <div class="sc-contact-icon">📱</div>
              <div class="sc-contact-details">
                <span class="sc-contact-label">Instant WhatsApp Support</span>
                <span class="sc-contact-value">+91 73009 69491</span>
                <span class="sc-contact-sub">Fastest response • Mon–Sat 10AM–7PM</span>
              </div>
              <span class="sc-contact-cta">Chat Now &rarr;</span>
            </a>

            <a href="mailto:scrunchandcreate@gmail.com" class="sc-contact-card sc-contact-card--email">
              <div class="sc-contact-icon">✉️</div>
              <div class="sc-contact-details">
                <span class="sc-contact-label">Email Inquiries</span>
                <span class="sc-contact-value">scrunchandcreate@gmail.com</span>
                <span class="sc-contact-sub">Response within 24 business hours</span>
              </div>
              <span class="sc-contact-cta">Send Email &rarr;</span>
            </a>

            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/scrunch_and_create" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sc-contact-card sc-contact-card--instagram">
              <div class="sc-contact-icon">📸</div>
              <div class="sc-contact-details">
                <span class="sc-contact-label">Instagram Community</span>
                <span class="sc-contact-value">@scrunch_and_create</span>
                <span class="sc-contact-sub">Follow for new drops &amp; behind-the-scenes</span>
              </div>
              <span class="sc-contact-cta">Follow Us &rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-policy-card" style="margin-top: 24px;">
            <h3>Operational Address</h3>
            <p>
              <strong>Scrunch &amp; Create Studio</strong><br>
              Handcrafted Hair Accessories &amp; Curated Gift Sets<br>
              India<br>
              Operating Hours: Monday – Saturday (10:00 AM – 7:00 PM IST)
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick WhatsApp Help Strip -->
  <div class="sc-policy-help-strip">
    <div class="sc-help-text">
      <span class="sc-help-emoji">💬</span>
      <div>
        <strong>Have a specific question about our policies?</strong>
        <p>Our friendly customer support team is always happy to assist you directly on WhatsApp.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="https://wa.me/917300969491?text=Hi%20Scrunch%20%26%20Create,%20I%20have%20a%20policy%20question" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sc-help-btn">
      Chat on WhatsApp
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .sc-policy-section {
    padding-top: 36px;
    padding-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .sc-policy-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
  }

  .sc-policy-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #fff0f3;
    color: #e78592;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .sc-policy-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 38px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #2c2024;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .sc-policy-subtitle {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #6d5b62;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sc-policy-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* Navigation Sidebar */
  .sc-policy-nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 16px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid #f2e6ea;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(74, 28, 64, 0.04);
    position: sticky;
    top: 76px;
  }

  .sc-policy-tab {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: transparent;
    color: #4a3e43;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .sc-policy-tab:hover {
    background: #fff5f7;
    color: #e78592;
  }

  .sc-policy-tab.is-active {
    background: #fff0f3;
    color: #d96b7a;
    border-color: #ffd6df;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(231, 133, 146, 0.15);
  }

  .sc-tab-icon {
    font-size: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .sc-tab-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  /* Policy Content Area */
  .sc-policy-content-wrap {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid #f2e6ea;
    padding: 36px 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(74, 28, 64, 0.04);
    min-height: 520px;
  }

  .sc-policy-panel {
    display: none;
    animation: scFadeIn 0.3s ease;
  }

  .sc-policy-panel.is-active {
    display: block;
  }

  @keyframes scFadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .sc-panel-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f5ecf0;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .sc-panel-icon-wrap {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    background: #fff0f3;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .sc-panel-title {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #2c2024;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }

  .sc-panel-updated {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #927e86;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Cards and Highlighting */
  .sc-panel-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .sc-policy-card {
    background: #faf7f8;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border: 1px solid #f2e6ea;
  }

  .sc-policy-card h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2c2024;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .sc-policy-card p,
  .sc-policy-card ul,
  .sc-policy-card ol {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #55444b;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sc-policy-card ul,
  .sc-policy-card ol {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .sc-highlight-box {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .sc-highlight-box--pink {
    background: #fff0f3;
    border: 1px solid #ffd6df;
    color: #8c2436;
  }

  .sc-highlight-box--green {
    background: #f0fdf4;
    border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
    color: #166534;
  }

  /* Shipping Grid Stats */
  .sc-policy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .sc-policy-stat-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #f2e6ea;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 12px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(74, 28, 64, 0.03);
  }

  .sc-stat-num {
    display: block;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #e78592;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .sc-stat-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #6d5b62;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Contact Grid */
  .sc-contact-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .sc-contact-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    background: #faf7f8;
    border: 1px solid #f2e6ea;
    border-radius: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .sc-contact-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(74, 28, 64, 0.08);
  }

  .sc-contact-card--whatsapp:hover {
    border-color: #25d366;
    background: #f0fdf4;
  }

  .sc-contact-card--email:hover {
    border-color: #e78592;
    background: #fff0f3;
  }

  .sc-contact-card--instagram:hover {
    border-color: #e1306c;
    background: #fff0f5;
  }

  .sc-contact-icon {
    font-size: 26px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .sc-contact-details {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .sc-contact-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #8c767f;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .sc-contact-value {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2c2024;
  }

  .sc-contact-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #7a666e;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .sc-contact-cta {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #e78592;
  }

  /* Bottom Help Strip */
  .sc-policy-help-strip {
    margin-top: 36px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f3 0%, #fff7f9 100%);
    border: 1px solid #ffd6df;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 22px 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .sc-help-text {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
